{#-
  Ratings slots (SPEC §12): placed now so the layouts don't move when the
  widget arrives. Both macros render NOTHING until M4.

    {% from "partials/rating.njk" import rating, ratingStatus %}
    {% if site.features.ratings %}{{ rating(video, page_id, 'row') }}{% endif %}

  rating(video, pageId, variant)  the widget, under a video and before its
                                  FormatLinks. variant: 'row' (problem video,
                                  Start here bar) or 'card' (open solution card)
  ratingStatus(video, pageId)     the one-line status in a closed solution
                                  card's meta row

  M4: SPEC §12 widget renders here. Its wording follows SPEC §12, not the
  boards: a <fieldset> with legend "Was this helpful?", five radio stars
  ("1 star" to "5 stars", 44x44px targets), the status "Ratings are
  anonymous." / "Thanks. You rated this 4 of 5.", then notices/ratings.njk.
  No stored ID. Not the boards' "How helpful was this?", "Helpful?",
  "Not rated yet" or aria-pressed toggle buttons.
-#}
{%- macro rating(video, pageId, variant='row') -%}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro ratingStatus(video, pageId) -%}{%- endmacro -%}
